Subject: winedmo: retire stale packets and EOS waits across rapid seeks
License: LGPL-2.1-or-later
Modification date: 2026-10-24

Keep repeated absolute seeks and downstream flushing from the OP sync repair.
Tag video-clock waits, packet enqueue, EOS publication and EOF waits with the
seek generation. A short forward/backward seek may finish before a worker
observes the transient flushing flag; the generation makes that transition
persistent and prevents old work from blocking or ending the new segment.
Use the shared generation predicate and condition variable for EOS waits.

